  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Parliamentary Accountability Programme (PAP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Greater Parliamentary autonomy, transparency and effectiveness in overseeing publicspending and engaging Rwandan citizens.To increase parliamentary autonomy, transparency and effectiveness in overseeing public spending. This will contribute towards poverty reduction by reducing waste and increasing value for money in public expenditure by 2016; and will be achieved by supporting Parliament (and particularly the Public Accounts Committee) to strengthen parliamentary scrutiny and government accountability to Parliament over its management of public finances.</narrative>
  </description>
